INT. COUNTY MORGUE - NIGHT

Steel drawers. Cold fluorescent light. A radiator knocks. A gurney in the center.

DR. HILDEGARD OYELOWO-STRAND, 50s, in scrubs, writes a label. Her assistant, MARCUS PELL, 20s, wheels in a covered body. The night guard, EUGENE FAIRBANKS, 60s, sips coffee near the door.

HILDEGARD
Last one tonight.

MARCUS
Where do I put him?

HILDEGARD
Drawer fourteen.

Marcus wheels the gurney to the wall. He opens the drawer. It's already occupied.

MARCUS
Dr. Strand?

HILDEGARD
What?

MARCUS
Fourteen's full.

HILDEGARD
It can't be.

She crosses. They both look in. A sheet. A shape. Hildegard flips back a corner. A pale face. Marcus gasps.

MARCUS
That's the same guy.

HILDEGARD
That's impossible.

She looks at the gurney. Lifts the sheet there. The same face.

HILDEGARD (CONT'D)
(whispering)
Eugene. Eugene, come look.

EUGENE
I don't want to.

HILDEGARD
Come look.

EUGENE
I'm on break.

HILDEGARD
Eugene.

He sets down the coffee. Comes over, reluctant. Looks at the two faces. Pales.

EUGENE
Oh, hell.

MARCUS
Maybe it's twins.

EUGENE
Twins don't die the same day.

HILDEGARD
They do sometimes.

MARCUS
Do they?

HILDEGARD
It happens.

Lights flicker. A drawer slides open on its own. Another. Then another. Down the long row, one by one, the drawers roll out. Cold fog spills across the floor.

EUGENE ^
Not again.

MARCUS
Not again?

EUGENE
Last time was '98.

HILDEGARD
What happened in '98?

EUGENE
They all sat up.

Silence. The radiator stops knocking. Sheets rustle. Marcus slowly retreats against the wall. Hildegard grabs a scalpel and holds it like a talisman.

HILDEGARD
(trembling)
Everyone stay calm.

A hand lifts from drawer fourteen and grips the edge.

HILDEGARD (CONT'D)
Eugene. Lock the door.

EUGENE
It's already locked.

HILDEGARD
From the outside?

EUGENE
(realizing)
From the outside.

The lights go out. Somewhere, a gurney wheel squeaks. Hildegard's breath catches. Then a voice, small and cheerful, from the dark.

BODY (V.O.)
Evening, doctor.

The lights flick on. Every drawer is open. Every sheet is empty.
